    "title": "Alabama Law Sets Limits on Probation and Violation Penalties - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kyle Ellington ,\n1 days ago\nTwo Somerville brothers once charged with felony burglary and assault in an alleged baseball bat attack will serve no additional jail time. Jason Thomas Pope, 36, and Justin Tyler Pope, 34, both pleaded guilty this month to reduced misdemeanor charges stemming from a 2023 incident in Morgan County. Both walked away with probation.\nRead full article",
